{"title":"Gristlejaw","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Gristlejaw is a named <a href=\"#/monster/hill-giant-behemoth\">Hill Giant Behemoth</a> seen at level 27.</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Where to find Gristlejaw</h2>\n      \n      <ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Behemoth's%20Wallow\">Behemoth&#39;s Wallow</a></li></ul>\n      \n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"npc\" data-map-id=\"gristlejaw\">Show on map</button>\n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra\"><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">8 drops</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"werewolfpelt-legs\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/d665ef86050cc2f37c8d.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Werewolfpelt Legs</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1 drop</span></div></div></div>\n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/ccdf417fc3d69d1ad283.webp\" alt=\"\"></div><h3>Gristlejaw</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Kind</th><td><a href=\"#/monster/hill-giant-behemoth\">Hill Giant Behemoth</a></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td>27</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>300</td></tr><tr><th>Seen</th><td>3 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}